ight at worst 2026 09 02 10 16 diana releas blocker 2026 09 02 10 17 bob copi 2026 09 02 1018 evan it stay open a far a i m concern this isn t someth we can work around on the engin side we need the certif 2026 09 02 10 59 alic let s keep it open on the releas gate rather than push it off the board i ll chase the certif process\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee0452768a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"id\": \"4eeefef9fc806102\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4423751414566864, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2685933706524092, \"vector_similarity\": 0.84786594, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee0452768a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 927, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:08:14\", \"token_count\": 288, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-39\\n\\n# Compatibility Audit: Windows Build Signing Gap\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2039\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02\\n\\n## Background: Path Fix Cleared Packaging\\n\\nBackslash path-handling defects that previously broke Windows builds were fixed on 2026-08-10, and a Windows build artifact was successfully produced by 2026-08-12. Packaging itself is no longer the blocker.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-39\\n\\n# Compatibility Audit: Windows Build Signing Gap\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2039\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02\\n\\n## Current Blocker: Missing Code-Signing Certificate\\n\\nThe produced build artifact is unsigned, which triggers a SmartScreen warning and Defender flagging the binary as untrusted.\\n\\n- **Impact**: Site IT policies commonly block execution of unsigned/SmartScreen-flagged binaries outright, which would prevent installation on target deployment workstations without a manual security-policy override.\\n\\n- **Root Cause**: No code-signing certificate has been procured or configured in the Windows build pipeline yet.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-39\\n\\n# Compatibility Audit: Windows Build Signing Gap\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2039\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02\\n\\n## Path to Resolution\\n\\nProcuring a code-signing certificate and wiring signing into the release build step is the only remaining item before this clears the T029 Windows compatibility gate — and, by extension, the T011 release checklist, which is holding on this exact signing gap alongside the T005 image slim-down.\\n\\n*Audit Status*: Active. Build produces successfully; signing certificate procurement is the sole open blocker.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 39 compat audit window build sign gap owner evan document key doc 2039 last updat 2026 09 02 background path fix clear packag backslash path handl defect that previous broke window build were fix on 2026 08 10 and a window build artifact wa success produc by 2026 08 12 packag itself is no longer the blocker sourc id src gdoc 39 compat audit window build sign gap owner evan document key doc 2039 last updat 2026 09 02 current blocker miss code sign certif the produc build artifact is unsign which trigger a smartscreen warn and defend flag the binari a untrust impact site it polici common block execut of unsign smartscreen flag binari outright which would prevent instal on target deploy workstat without a manual secur polici overrid root caus no code sign certif ha been procur or configur in the window build pipelin yet sourc id src gdoc 39 compat audit window build sign gap owner evan document key doc 2039 last updat 2026 09 02 path to resolut procur a code sign certif and wire sign into the releas build step is the onli remain item befor this clear the t029 window compat gate and by extens the t011 releas checklist which is hold on this exact sign gap alongsid the t005 imag slim down audit status activ build produc success sign certif procur is the sole open blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee9526168a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"id\": \"3a7b937808b6fadd\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.42808209488509313, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.26335556412156164, \"vector_similarity\": 0.812444, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee9526168a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1340, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:00\", \"token_count\": 387, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-39\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Windows builds and clear Defender/SmartScreen signing\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nMake the redaction suite compatible with Windows, including build packaging. A Windows build artifact now exists, but Windows Defender/SmartScreen blocks the unsigned build because a code-signing certificate is still missing; the task remains active pending that certificate.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-39\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Windows builds and clear Defender/SmartScreen signing\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Windows build artifact is produced successfully.\\n\\n- Build is code-signed with a valid certificate so it is not blocked by Defender/SmartScreen.\\n\\n- Signed build passes Windows Defender/SmartScreen without warnings.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-39\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Windows builds and clear Defender/SmartScreen signing\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nMake the redaction suite compatible with Windows, including build packaging. A Windows build artifact now exists, but Windows Defender/SmartScreen blocks the unsigned build because a code-signing certificate is still missing; the task remains active pending that certificate.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-39\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Windows builds and clear Defender/SmartScreen signing\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-08**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because Windows OS compatibility is required for the release gate.*\\n\\n- **2026-09-02**: Evan - Signing Cert Missing (Active)\\n\\n - *Found that Windows Defender/SmartScreen blocks the unsigned build because a code-signing certificate is still missing; task remains active.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 descript make the redact suit compat with window includ build packag a window build artifact now exist but window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss the task remain activ pend that certif clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 accept criterion window build artifact is produc success build is code sign with a valid certif so it is not block by defend smartscreen sign build pass window defend smartscreen without warn clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 descript make the redact suit compat with window includ build packag a window build artifact now exist but window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss the task remain activ pend that certif clickup task ciph 39 sourc id src cu ciph 39 task id ciph 39 titl fix window build and clear defend smartscreen sign status activ assigne evan prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 activ histori 2026 08 08 alic task creat open open the task becaus window o compat is requir for the releas gate 2026 09 02 evan sign cert miss activ found that window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss task remain activ\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee4d7cc68a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-39-Windows-Compatibility.md\", \